<p class="eyebrow" data-copy-en="Character guide" data-copy-zh="角色攻略">Character guide</p>
<h1 data-copy-en="The Blessed Ones" data-copy-zh="The Blessed Ones">The Blessed Ones</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Find the Blessed Ones at the Anomaly Temple and understand their current role in exploration." data-copy-zh="在异常神殿找到 The Blessed Ones，了解拜访方式与当前可用内容。">Find the Blessed Ones at the Anomaly Temple and understand their current role in exploration.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">A temple encounter</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find them</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">What to do on arrival</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Available interaction</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">If you expected a route</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">异常神殿的一次会面</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">在哪里遇见</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">到达后做什么</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">可以进行的互动</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">为什么没有后续行动</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Shared_Temple_Encounter_with_Pixel"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="How_to_Meet_Them"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Info"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>A temple encounter</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: The Blessed Ones — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/the-blessed-ones.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="The Blessed Ones — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/the-blessed-ones.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>The Blessed Ones — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>The Blessed Ones are a group you can encounter at the Anomaly Temple in the Future. Visit to hear the temple’s ambient dialogue and discover the place for yourself.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><h2>Where to find them</h2><p>Open <strong>Future → Prime Sector → Anomaly Temple</strong>. They are present <strong>all day, every day</strong>; no relationship stage or personal introduction is needed.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><h2>What to do on arrival</h2><p>Enter the temple and select their portrait. This is a discovery visit: there is no personal quest chain, recruitment, date or Heart-to-Heart attached to their entry.</p></section>
<section id="en-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Current_Interaction_Limits"></span><h2>Available interaction</h2><p>Their portrait provides ambient remarks. There is no separate Talk or gift action, relationship progression, skill lesson or repeatable reward to unlock.</p></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Troubleshooting"></span><h2>If you expected a route</h2><ul><li>An empty character-action list is normal for this encounter.</li><li>Repeated temple visits do not unlock a hidden affection threshold.</li><li>Temple residents have separate entries; use the name on the portrait to identify this group.</li></ul></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="locations.html">Locations — the Future districts</a></li><li><a href="characters.html">Characters — other people to meet</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Shared_Temple_Encounter_with_Pixel"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-How_to_Meet_Them"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Info"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><h2>异常神殿的一次会面</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：The Blessed Ones 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/the-blessed-ones.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="The Blessed Ones 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/the-blessed-ones.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>The Blessed Ones 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>The Blessed Ones 是未来异常神殿中可以遇到的一群人。到神殿看看、听听他们的日常对白，就能亲自认识这处地点。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><h2>在哪里遇见</h2><p>前往<strong>未来 → 核心区 → 异常神殿</strong>。他们<strong>每天全天都在</strong>，出现不要求关系阶段，也不需要先完成个人介绍。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><h2>到达后做什么</h2><p>进入神殿，选择他们的头像即可。这是一项探索内容，目前没有与此条目相连的个人任务链、招募、约会或谈心。</p></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Current_Interaction_Limits"></span><h2>可以进行的互动</h2><p>头像会显示日常对白，没有另设交谈、送礼、提升好感、学习技能或领取重复奖励的行动。</p></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Troubleshooting"></span><h2>为什么没有后续行动</h2><ul><li>个人行动列表为空是正常情况。</li><li>反复拜访不会解锁隐藏的好感门槛。</li><li>神殿内不同人物各有条目，按头像上的名字确认即可。</li></ul></section>
<section id="zh-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Related_Pages"></span><h2>相关指南</h2><ul><li><a href="locations.html">地点：未来各区域</a></li><li><a href="characters.html">人物：继续认识其他人</a></li></ul></section>
